        {
          "path": "_m/s/g/u/6/jabal-al-nour-wp/my-quest-modernize-pic.jpg",
          "filename": "Jabbal An-Nour (2024).jpg",
          "caption": "In my quest to modernize the pictures of the holy cities, One cannot miss the great mountains of Jabbal An-Nour in Mecca. You might know, pilgrims need to cross this great mountain to get to the caves of hira. To climb this mountain, you need to trek above the Rocky hills. formerly on the other side of this mountain photo.\nRecently, the Saudi government have destroyed parts of the Mountain to ease pilgrims to reach the top, by building, a relatively steep but safe road connecting the top with the tol road. this is where pilgrims preferred to trek now.",
          "alt": "In my quest to modernize the pictures of the holy cities, One cannot miss the great mountains of Jabbal An-Nour in Mecca. You might know, pilgrims need to cross this great mountain to get to the caves of hira. To climb this mountain, you need to trek above the Rocky hills. formerly on the other side of this mountain photo.\nRecently, the Saudi government have destroyed parts of the Mountain to ease pilgrims to reach the top, by building, a relatively steep but safe road connecting the top with the tol road. this is where pilgrims preferred to trek now.",
